{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b8ba47e8279a258d0eb10175afc472c2f94bc411eaf60dcd2f76f3caa7a83bef","ja":"年末年始の魔物！","zh":"跨年假期的魔物！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"53e9b2c9057d5c4f0c6211bf6fd394a8dfb5de036709fc681c6ccebb78371fc1","ja":"えっ……実家が快適でのんびりできるから、\n帰りたくないんですか……！？","zh":"咦……因为老家很舒服又过得悠闲，\n所以不想回去了吗……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d3adc994d5ac12b97d8ea26052c8952fbb24f56d02cf90a80541c4995b1ab5e8","ja":"でもそれって、おかしくない？\n自分なら、すぐにでも帰りたくなっちゃうぞ！","zh":"但那样不是很奇怪吗？\n换作是我的话，肯定马上就想回去了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1addf7a842b421da1d45970b0b4705d9d73fa979be36c74d969600fbc5ee8ce6","ja":"そこが実家の罠なんだって！　1日ぐうたらしてたら、\nどんどん体がなまっていくだろ。","zh":"这就是回老家的陷阱啊！要是懒散过上1天，\n身体可就会越来越迟钝了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"34c061c7243a4e44a3882e9bdd1e8efa30b5912b52176e59f07d40bb0da6b451","ja":"それに年末年始だ！　ゴロゴロしてても\n美味しい食べ物がたくさんでてきて……。","zh":"而且又是年末年初！就算无所事事地闲躺着，\n也会有好多好吃的送上门来……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1dc5d40abf4c581f94210de6c7e682f8a6ac0df5430fa338e78e1b16a4241f22","ja":"そして、実家を出るときには……マイガー！\n考えただけで恐ろしくなってきた！","zh":"然后，在离开老家的时候……My God！\n光是想想就觉得太可怕了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1cb288554ad6e5f6e96873de2eea9600a325eb00cb44cd3c81d0ccadb9e1a7e3","ja":"そ、その不安、ちょっと分かるかも……。\nわ、私も、年末年始は気つけなきゃって……。","zh":"那、那种不安，我好像有点懂……\n我、我也觉得到了年末年初必须得注意才行……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f0bf88d8b3113924b64f7b3bf84b4fabef3448677bb9dac1640c2ed1f9a0a857","ja":"あっ、わかったぞ！　ふたりとも、見た目が\nだらしなくなっちゃうことを気にしているんだね！","zh":"啊，我知道了！你们两个是在担心看起来\n会显得邋遢对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b0504d31758d4146373d93be3b2164d70410cce020d0a85fa2b80adc5ba2bd14","ja":"ううう……。\n響ちゃん、そんなにはっきり言わなくても……。","zh":"呜呜呜……\n响，也不用说得这么直白嘛……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d6429a97e000a1101214a3eb7b08f55d35a006a8ed4237917593ed06d8cdfe3e","ja":"でも、それなら自分にいい考えがあるぞ！","zh":"不过，既然这样，我倒是有个好主意！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"98921ef9a80b20ac1377afa902cfa38d8f9134a5e9936e28d97b6843dafb4695","ja":"えっ！　頼む、響！\nその考え、アタシに教えてくれ！","zh":"哎！拜托了，响！\n把那个想法告诉我吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1342.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2a09354e102b4a7cb69ebf43ce2993646eed11cc6ccea05010e269d14a05bac1","ja":"あ、あの……よかったら、\n私にも教えてほしいな……。","zh":"那个，那个……如果可以的话，\n也希望能教教我呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
